	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div xml:id="div1" corresp="regest1">
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>Gratiam et pacem a deo, patre nostro, et domino Iesu Christo.</s>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la">Amen.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la">Quando <lb xml:id="p1z2"/>te (optime vir) non solum omnium ecclesiarum, sed et omnium fratrum <lb xml:id="p1z3"/>anxiam curam gerere sciam, res meas, quas et nuper tecum <lb xml:id="p1z4"/>contuleram, ac scripta schedula<note xml:id="fn1" type="footnote" n="1">Nicht erhalten.</note>, si quando casus<note xml:id="fn2" type="footnote" n="2">Über den Fall ist im einzelnen nichts bekannt.</note> exigeret, ut memorarentur, <lb xml:id="p1z5"/>tibi reliqueram, quem in finem abierint, pro tua singulari in <lb xml:id="p1z6"/>me benevolentia nequaquam cęlare volui.</s>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la">Ego enim, pro augusta <lb xml:id="p1z7"/>veritatis maiestate, omnes semel illius inimicos confundi spero.</s>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z8"/><persName ref="p7210">Prefectus</persName><note xml:id="fn3" type="footnote" n="3"><persName ref="p7210">Mansuet Zumbrunnen</persName>, von <placeName ref="l781">Uri</placeName>, 1536-1538 eidgenössischer Landvogt im <placeName ref="l774">Thurgau</placeName>.</note> enim cum in ius me citatum in tertium usque iuris diem <lb xml:id="p1z9"/>presentem me sine accusatore haberet nulliusque<pb type="edition" next="183"/> me reum ageret, <lb xml:id="p1z10"/>ipse ego iudicem ius meum rogans, pręfectus me liberum dixit; <lb xml:id="p1z11"/>quo id vero consilio, scire non possum.</s>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la">Apologiam igitur meam, <lb xml:id="p1z12"/>quam in scriptis tibi dedi<note xml:id="fn4" type="footnote" n="4">Nicht erhalten.</note>, a publico retractes velim, ne vel <lb xml:id="p1z13"/>olim modo quovis novorum incendia iurgiorum esse possint.</s>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la">Si <lb xml:id="p1z14"/>forsan dominus ęquiorem de veritate sentiendi animum praestiterit, <lb xml:id="p1z15"/>nullam nostri causa offensionem impatientibus querelis prebeamus.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z16"/>Ceterum sedula opera, consilio ac sumptu mea me adiuvit ecclesia <lb xml:id="p1z17"/>eximiam diligentiam et amorem in me exhibens, omnes item fratres; <lb xml:id="p1z18"/>ut primum precibus et cura pro me rebusque ecclesię erant anxii, ita <lb xml:id="p1z19"/>plurimum nunc et ecclesię et mihi congratulantur.</s>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la">Reddat illis dominus <lb xml:id="p1z20"/>ęternam lęticiam pro illorum in me amore et studio.</s>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la">Tu pro tua <lb xml:id="p1z21"/>in nos charitate nobiscum domino semper gratias agas.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la" ana="farewell">Vale.</s>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la">Omnes <lb xml:id="p1z22"/>te fratres semper salvum sedulo pręcantur.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="la">Quinta die iulii <lb xml:id="p1z23"/>anno 37.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z24"/><persName ref="p2237">Martinus Mötyly</persName>, semper tuus.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="de"><lb xml:id="p1z25"/>Ex <placeName ref="l538">Winfelden</placeName> <placeName ref="l774">Thurgoę</placeName>.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<note type="address">[Adresse auf der Rückseite:]</note>
					<s n="16" xml:lang="la"><pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/>Simul piissimo doctissimoque viro <lb xml:id="p2z2"/>M. <persName ref="p495">Gheimrycho<note xml:id="fn5" type="footnote" n="5">Zur Namensform vgl. <persName ref="p2237">Möttelis</persName> Ausführungen im Brief vom 2. Januar 1536 (<bibl source="b8">HBBW VI</bibl> <ref target="file10747">[Nr. 709]</ref>, S. 34, 18-23).</note> Bullingero</persName>, <lb xml:id="p2z3"/>domino ac fratri suo semper amantissimo.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
		</body>
	</text>
